  "title": "Icon Is Ready for Its Next Chapter of Restomods",
  "summary": "We’ve driven several builds from Icon 4×4, the Chatsworth, California, shop that has turned out hundreds of high-end restomods. The majority of its builds—more than 350 now—have relied on a custom chassis. Icon has a decades-long relationship with Art Morrison, who builds the chassis for Icon’s Bronco-, Toyota FJ-, and Chevrolet Thriftmaster-based lines of vehicles. […]",
